      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FILLY THIRTEEN (7) produced yet another strong performance last start when she battled on bravely to just miss out over 1780m at this track, adding to a string of recent minor placings. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Big chance based on that latest outing. TAURUS BROMAC NZ (9) has been a bit hot and cold and that continued last start when he finished third, beaten 2.5 metres, in a nice return to form at this track over 1780m. Not drawn to best so may need a 10/10 drive. Finds a nice race and will take plenty of beating once more. THREE CHORD RIFF (4) didn't do a bad job when sixth over 1780m at this track last time out. SAYCHELLES (6) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish third at this track over 1780m.",
